---
description: Sellbase commerce rules
alwaysApply: true
---
This project sells with Sellbase. Use the `sellbase` MCP server; start with `store_status`.
Money is integer minor units (19990 = $199.90). Never compute prices in the browser.
Orders come only from payment webhooks; verify with `test_purchase`.
Do not edit supabase/migrations/0000–0002_* or supabase/functions/sellbase-*; extend with `metadata`.
Never expose the service role key or print `.env.sellbase`.
